        <h3>One page, the whole project.</h3>
        <p>A render slider up top, an "Enquire now" button pinned above it, then everything on tabs: the overview, unit types, and construction updates. Amenities, a location map, and downloads for the brochure, fact sheet and floor plans sit inline — no jumping out to a website.</p>
      </div>
