        <h3>Construction updates, dated.</h3>
        <p>Each project keeps a timeline of site photos by date, with an empty state that promises the first one is coming. When the team posts an update — or a new render, or an offer — it goes out as a push, so following a project is a reason to keep the app installed.</p>
