<!-- SHIP -->
<section class="case-section">
  <h2>The ship.</h2>
  <div class="copy">
    <p>Reportage shipped to the App Store and Google Play as a native bilingual app, backed by an admin web where the marketing team manages projects, communities, offers, the media center and announcements, and fires push notifications.</p>
    <p>Every layout was designed twice — once left-to-right, once mirrored — so Arabic is a first-class reading experience, not a flipped afterthought. The design system was handed over with both directions specified.</p>
  </div>
</section>

